WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'show_trigger' to 'trigger_show' 'set_trigger' to 'trigger_store'
#262: FILE: arch/x86/kernel/cpu/mcheck/dev-mcelog.c:134:
